{"type": "FeatureCollection", "features": [{"type": "Feature", "properties": {"name": "France (southeast)", "note": "Southeast France: the France ADM0 outline (data/large_scale_embeddings/france.geojson) intersected with the bounding box (3.0, 42.8, 7.8, 46.5). 114,260 km2, 21% of France, and 29 jobs per year at job_size 8192 against all of France's 131 and Kenya's 124. Sized for validating a new model or a new store layout rather than for coverage: big enough that the queue drains and refills several times at 8 workers, so the supervisor's refill path is actually exercised, and small enough to finish in hours. Spans UTM zones 31 and 32 with the seam at longitude 6, so shards on either side overlap and check_zone_agreement has shared ground to compare. Chosen for terrain range: Mediterranean coast and the Camargue at sea level, Rhone valley farmland, and the Alps to 4,800 m. Flat uniform ground would validate the plumbing but not the model."}, "geometry": {"type": "MultiPolygon", "coordinates": [[[[3.042645945000061, 43.00969207400004], [3.0361902903246825, 42.8], [3.0, 42.8], [3.0, 43.00969207400004], [3.042645945000061, 43.00969207400004]]], [[[6.115999210000041, 46.48143845700008], [6.114501292000057, 46.45667800900003], [6.118995046000066, 46.44429356200004], [6.132476309000026, 46.43500337800003], [6.139965898000071, 46.425711611000054], [6.123488801000065, 46.41125460100005], [6.07855126100003, 46.38026238700007], [6.062074162000044, 46.35648977000005], [6.06057624400006, 46.33167252900006], [6.062074162000044, 46.31098289000005], [6.089972885000066, 46.30354563900005], [6.115999210000041, 46.28200424900007], [6.153447160000042, 46.270615587000066], [6.154945079000072, 46.250938688000076], [6.144459652000023, 46.23436319000007], [6.118995046000066, 46.21156370300008], [6.104015866000054, 46.19082868000004], [6.105513784000038, 46.17216046900006], [6.104015866000054, 46.15037287800004], [6.071061670000063, 46.12338581100005], [6.038107474000071, 46.111964224000